    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L14-ACTIVITY-011",
      "SourceSection": "14.3: Spinning Fan",
      "SourceExcerpt": "I attach a laser beam to the fan at the same point \\(P\\) at position \\(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\) so that the laser points away from the center of the fan. At the starting position the laser beam hits the right wall near the ceiling and does so until…",
