    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L14-ACTIVITY-014",
      "SourceSection": "14.3: Spinning Fan",
      "SourceExcerpt": "The graphs of cosine and sine functions can be translated vertically or horizontally and the size or height of their graphs can also be modified similar to how we transformed other types of functions in an earlier unit. Let’s look at the…",
