      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L14-ACTIVITY-015",
      "SourceSection": "14.3: Spinning Fan",
      "SourceExcerpt": "The coefficient 2 stretches the graph vertically, doubling the amplitude of the sine graph. This means that the distance from the midline to the maximum or minimum value is now 2 instead of 1. Adding 3 to the equation translates the…",
