      "SourceSection": "14.3: Spinning Fan",
      "SourceExcerpt": "What if we want to translate the graph of \\(y = \\sin(\\theta)\\) to the left? We can do this by adding an angle to the input \\(\\theta\\). Let’s look at the graph of \\(y = \\sin\\left(\\theta + \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)\\). The graph of this function…",
